WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.700
OPERATION GIANT ROLLER

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.630
"Operation Giant Roller".

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.130
Shallows...

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:45.160
No way the Motorad Fleet is around here.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.030
Huh?

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:48.100
Marbet's unit is returning.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:49.260
I know.

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:56.100
I think the BESPA fleet landed a lot of ships onto Earth, but...

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.130
They have not vanished! They are hiding!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.460
If that's what you think, then try finding them!

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:04.000
Where have they taken my mom and Shahkti?

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.500
My toilet pack's already full up!

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:22.200
Damn amateurs! What, I gotta sit in my own piss...

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:25.660
...as punishment for not saving Underhook?!

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:28.360
There it goes...

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.860
Fish? That might mean...

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.100
This was worth pissing myself for.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.700
I'll just use this underwater cable.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.730
This is Gun Blaster 1, Odelo.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:50.000
White Ark! Three Einerads just showed up!

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.060
It's the vanguard of the BESPA fleet!

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.960
He's saying we need to inform the Reineforce, at once!

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:59.260
How's Tomáš doing?

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.460
Ready to head out. You all set?

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.130
All set. I'm heading out!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.000
Go on!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.460
Roger! Clear the deck of any mobile suits in operation.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.600
I'll talk to Chavarri.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:26.360
What kind of idiot just shows up without any warning?!

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.730
You haven't changed!

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.130
Hello, everyone! You're looking well.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.860
Hello! Good to have you here.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.400
Looks like the League Militaire on Earth are coming here.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.630
Right. We're concentrating our numbers.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.400
And it looks like the Federation Forces here on Earth are also helping us.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:46.860
The emergency is we've got word that the tire ships are headed for Mexico.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.660
I see. That course would match with what Odelo just reported.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.330
Shrike Team, intercept the Motorad Fleet!

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:07.230
Three ships, not just one! And another one, over here!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.700
Trying to surface, huh? Not if I can help it...

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:30.260
A rat on the ocean floor! We knew you were following us!

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:38.000
It's your bad luck you were spotted by our new model Zollidia!

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.930
There appears to just be one enemy, Commandant.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.200
Shall I go after it?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:53.000
We have word the rebel elements are approaching.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.000
Shall I leave them to Goz Barl?

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.000
I'd prefer that.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.660
Catching up to Pippiniden's Rasteo comes first.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.600
Besides, if we let him get in a skirmish,

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:05.400
and widen our mobile suits' deployment, it'll deceive the enemy.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.100
Yes, sir.

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:23.730
Allowing me to lead the Motorad Fleet shows Cronicle's strengths.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.360
Rasteo, commencing landing operations!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.730
Right! Do it!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.330
Initiating Operation Earth Clean!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.260
All hands, prepare for land battle!

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.330
Open a channel to Duker Iq.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:35.260
Aye, sir!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.000
How goes it, Lt. Commander Duker Iq?

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.860
Sir, I'm moved.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:45.600
Because the Motorad ships will finally see combat under gravity.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:49.900
And if we smash that white suit, you'll have nothing left to wish for.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.560
As you say, sir.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:55.460
But our top priority now is to cleanse the Earth...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.560
...and prepare it to receive Queen Maria.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:12.200
I was expecting a response. Where did it go?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.460
Where's Odelo? He's gone!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.060
Reinforcements!

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:27.830
Don't forget, this is the ocean!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.300
The tires move better in water than we do?!

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:36.300
Another gift before I make landfall! I'll take it!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.530
Gotcha!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:40.460
What?!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:46.830
All right!

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:51.900
How did they...

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.900
I screwed up!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:04.000
You shouldn't relax till you're sure your enemy's dead!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.160
I'll be taking your tire, thanks!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:10.900
What?!

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.430
Where's the Reineforce?!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.700
The tire ships are moving straight forward!

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:35.830
Mizuho, you're a mechanic, not a pilot!

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:37.800
The Javelin's in perfect shape!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:41.100
I can do this! And for that monster of a ship...

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.430
I'll stop it!

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.300
It didn't stop?

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.500
W-Where's the shield?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:15.030
Mizuho! That's why I told you not to do it!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.660
Dammit! Stop, you monster!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:23.330
We will now test the effectiveness of our guns in atmosphere.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:23.930
Sir!

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.260
Three in the ocean, three in the city.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.030
What are you doing on the land?!

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.000
Üso, get to the city!

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:55.130
Run! Don't stop, just run!

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.430
Hurry! You can't stay here!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.300
You're crushing the people along with the city?!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.700
Üso, behind us!

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.400
You in the Gundam replica!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.200
Even you, Üso, won't be able to stop this operation!

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.660
Surrender quietly!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.230
That voice... Miss Katejina?

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.160
Miss Katejina, you'd do something like this?!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:24.360
Surrender, or I'll open fire!

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:27.260
I can't forgive this! You're helping them do this!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.160
Üso!

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:38.500
Not even using explosives, but crushing people and destroying their city?!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.160
It's worse than the guillotine!

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:43.200
Leave what rots to rot and burn what burns!

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:46.230
You refuse to understand the meaning of Operation Earth Clean!

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:51.760
For the sake of the children,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.200
Queen Maria wants to crush the filthy adults...

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.330
...and fertilize the Earth with them!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.860
Stop lying!

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.830
Üso! What are you doing?!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.100
That queen would never say that!

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.130
Reinforcements are coming?

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:32.060
My own body weight is helping to crush that city and its people?

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.130
Üso!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.330
What do you want?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.200
To go out.

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:37.330
Tell me what you want.

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.000
The window won't open.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.160
Please tell me what's happening outside.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.600
The commandant ordered that you not see it, Princess.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:45.900
My uncle did?

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:49.600
I can only say we're in the land leveling phase of the operation.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.060
This warship is leveling the land? What do you mean?

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.400
I can't answer that.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.060
Please, let me see my uncle!

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.700
I'm sorry, but...

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.130
I know you're doing something awful!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.460
Stop it! Please, stop it!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:19.700
Well, well... No doubt about it. You're a genuine pilot.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:23.060
And a man with a lot of pride, too.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:27.960
Tomáš and I have done our job. Take care of him, will you?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.700
Roger that! Odelo and Tomáš,

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.300
head into the city and cover Shrike Team's rear.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.160
Roger!

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:36.860
And don't head for the front, you two!

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.460
We know!

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.000
I'm using this tire, though.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.200
Tomáš, let's go!

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.460
Roger!

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.830
They're going overboard.

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.000
So what?

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:50.960
Those kids had the enthusiasm to capture a prisoner.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.960
I was just careless.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.760
That's right, the League Militaire...

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.660
...is trying to stop us without blowing up our mobile suits or ships.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.030
That's not our concern! Just attack them!

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.730
Goz Barl isn't here. Is Katejina's team operating?

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:21.360
Yes, and doing well.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:24.230
The air conditioning should be perfect, sir, so...

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.660
I can feel the dust on Earth.

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:33.260
It'd be simpler if we could just blow up the ships to stop them,

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.900
but since we can't...

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.300
We'll just have to deal with it.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.560
Shrike Team! Attack in waves more!

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:45.160
Just don't blow up any mobile suits or ships!

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.500
Dammit, if we cause a nuclear explosion by shooting one of you,

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:53.400
it'll wipe out the city and contaminate the Earth!

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:59.000
That means our only option is to fight at close range!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.630
To all mobile suits standing by on board!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.230
Capture the white one!

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:12.200
Except...

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.960
That new white monster has stopped moving?

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.230
Can it be? Mom?

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.660
Üso! Behind us!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.130
Friendly fire?

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:35.400
Pippiniden's advance fleet is moving towards the central city.

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:37.500
We've secured our route into North America.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:39.900
Fleet number two's movement is also on schedule.

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:43.360
All that remains is to lure the Reineforce out and destroy her.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:46.900
What?!

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:48.100
Damn!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.860
How dare you use our own Einerad against us!

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:55.660
That's how you use the Einerad's beam shield!

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:58.460
Tomáš!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:01.500
Üso!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.030
Odelo!

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.960
Üso, use the tire!

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:16.400
This tire can act as a barrier? Okay, then!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.660
If that was Mom, then that must be their flagship!

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:23.360
Left and right Lysitheas, forward!

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.700
The Einerad ahead is the white one!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.460
Out of my way!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.260
All Lysitheas, attack!

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.500
Have Katejina's team attack!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.830
She's already noticed that Einerad's movements!

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.800
How dare he!

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.730
I'm the one you're fighting!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.460
Over there?

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.130
Don't blow up the ship!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.100
I know!

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:02.760
It really is Mom!

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:10.430
Mom, I'll cut it open and get you out! Stand back!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.900
The white one's attacking! Lower the bridge!

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:25.460
Üso and the others are trying to stop what Cronicle's doing on this ship.

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:28.000
If Cronicle won't listen to me,

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.660
and they destroy this ship with a single blow...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.430
Is there a reason that the League Militaire won't destroy this ship?

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.160
I'll use all I've got!

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:44.160
Stop!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:48.500
The advance fleet is crushing the next central city!

00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.400
There may be a third wave coming!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:52.060
The next city?! A third wave?!

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:53.500
I've sent the data!

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:54.630
Reading it!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:02.100
So, our only choices are stop them with one blow, or alter their course?

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:04.260
A Federation Forces unit is en route!

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:06.900
All we can do is wear their forces down in the meantime!

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.730
Gotcha! I'll get them to change course!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.160
Üso! What are you planning?!

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.430
These tire guys are underestimating us!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.800
Üso! Where are we going?!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:20.700
There were League Militaire people here!

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:23.000
They must have at least one mobile suit left!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.760
That was Üso! What's he up to?!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.860
So, they've decided to try blowing us up.

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.160
Battlefield circumstances inevitably lead to this.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:46.060
This shouldn't affect Pippiniden's fleet.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.430
Approach the mountain range and pursue Pippiniden's Rasteo.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:50.060
Yes, sir!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:54.600
That shockwave! Did a mobile suit explode nearby?

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.530
It's all right, Karl.

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:01.230
In mobile suit battles, nuclear explosions occur.

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:06.130
But that may only be helping the Zanscare in their task, Üso.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.960
I'll use the nuclear fusion engine on this one.

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.330
Who just suicide attacked?!

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:26.400
Looks like it was Mãrklin in Shrike Team 2!

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:29.230
Juca, the Adrastea unit is escaping into the mountains!

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:31.500
Have you located their advance fleet, yet?

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.960
They're headed for the next city!

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:35.760
We need to do something while they're in front of us!

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:38.760
All we can do is keep hitting their mobile suits...

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.730
...and smashing their ships' weaponry!

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:42.830
What's keeping the Federation Forces?!

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:46.130
The Reineforce can't engage them ship-to-ship, either!

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:48.500
Suicide attacks like that may be the only option!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:50.230
Next time, it'll be against a ship!

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:51.930
You're talking nuclear war!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:53.630
V2?!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.630
Üso, what are you doing?

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.800
Unless we change their course and stop them,

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:05.500
we'll never save my mother! Or Shahkti!

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:06.960
I understand, Üso!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.830
But even the blast of one suit has to be done deeper in the mountains!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:14.360
Give the kid some cover, Marbet!

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.160
We have no choice!

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.630
More, out here?

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:24.060
The white one just dropped a mobile suit!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.960
He dropped a mobile suit?!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.860
Odelo, you're out too far!

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:28.930
Shut up!

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.100
The V2!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:31.930
Üso!

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:41.560
Become a shield to stop that tire ship!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.930
Become a wall, mobile suit!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:47.060
But, a nuclear explosion?

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.860
There's no such thing as a clean nuke!

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.860
Adrastea, please retreat!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.860
That mobile suit's going to explode!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.400
If it blows now, we can stop the flagship!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.430
What?!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:18.930
Main engines to full! Rendezvous with Pippiniden's unit!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:24.800
The Adrastea is withdrawing from the battlefield?

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:26.500
All units, do you copy?

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:32.630
Miss Juca! Are you all right?! Answer me, please!

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:34.630
Miss Juca, please hang on!

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:36.160
Üso?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.700
Üso! Juca! Cony! Shrike Team, come in!

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:46.660
Cronicle's unit really seems to be putting on a show.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.230
I suppose this means the League Militaire...

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:51.430
...are prepared to do anything to stop us.

00:19:56.060 --> 00:19:59.400
What? That was a nuclear blast. Was it a mobile suit?

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:02.830
When mobile suits fight each other, it happens.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:06.730
With the addition of the Federation Forces, next time, it'll be a fleet battle.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:08.960
And the destruction will be even greater.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:11.900
What about the plan to stop the enemy ships...

00:20:11.930 --> 00:20:13.700
...without blowing them up?

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:16.260
It was probably unrealistic from the start.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:17.960
Miss Juca!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:20.660
Did it work, Üso?

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:26.600
The lead cruiser was caught in the heart of the blast, but...

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.700
The battleship and its trailing ships are taking off!

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:32.560
Damn them!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.100
They're taking Mom away!

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.300
This ship's flying?

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:46.860
If this ship isn't destroyed here, we'll have even more trouble later!

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:51.260
How ignorant the League Militaire are!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:55.700
This Motorad vessel was designed to cleanse the Earth without using nukes,

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:59.360
and yet they attack us like this?!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:04.230
The Adrastea's changed course to rendezvous with us?

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:06.600
Yes, but there seems to be another problem.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:07.430
What?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.430
Listen to this message from Lt. Commander Duker Iq.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.460
What is it?

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:16.430
We've picked up Federation Forces silhouettes ahead of us.

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:20.360
So, the Motorad ships won't simply be cleaning, then.

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:23.330
But I'm confident we can engage them ship-to-ship.

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.160
Understood, Duker Iq.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:28.560
Show them the might of the Motorad Fleet!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.330
Sir!

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:34.230
Stop it, Üso! A single suit can't charge them!

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:39.860
We can't just let them go! We have to stop them!

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:42.200
Don't stop me!

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:44.760
We have to catch up to it! That ship...

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:46.760
What will charging it alone accomplish?!

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:49.860
The Reineforce has ordered us to return!

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:52.500
A pilot only sees a sliver of the situation!

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:56.360
You can't build a plan or win the war with that!

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:58.230
I don't care about this war anymore!

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.130
Üso!

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:00.530
You idiot!

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:07.960
WHY?!

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.060
The enemy fleet still hasn't stopped.

00:23:33.730 --> 00:23:36.460
Üso and the others hatch a plan...

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:40.130
...to use the prisoner and successfully infiltrate the Adrastea.

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:45.530
Üso and Odelo are able to meet up with me and Mrs. Myra,

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:50.260
but there, Üso must make a painful choice.

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:54.000
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:55.100
"Mother or Shahkti".

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:56.960
Next Episode MOTHER OR SHAHKTI

00:23:56.960 --> 00:23:58.230
Please watch it!
